    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Passive voice and transformation",
     "texto": [
      "The passive (**οι εργασίες αυτοματοποιούνται**) focuses attention on the process. **Δεν συνεπάγεται κατ’ ανάγκην…** avoids absolute conclusions.",
      "Notice what relationship each connector sets up and use it to express your own position."
